# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

> **Business Edition only.** This endpoint does not exist in Portainer CE.

Tests whether Portainer can reach an Alertmanager.

## Example Usage

```hcl
data "portainer_alerting_connectivity" "main" {
  url = "http://alertmanager.example.com:9093"
}
```

